	(text "ESP-01 plugs into a 2x4 2.54mm female socket (footprint ESP-01S).\nUART: master GP44 (UART0 TX) -> ESP RX, ESP TX -> master GP45 (UART0 RX).\nGP0/1 (debug header J UART M) is also UART0: firmware runs one of the two as a PIO UART.\nESP RST is button-only (S7 + R71 pull-up); master GP8 drives the master status LED. ESP flashing: hold ESP Boot\n(GPIO0 low) and press ESP Reset. Pull-ups keep it in normal boot when the RP2350 pin floats.\n  100u + 10u + 100n near the socket for TX bursts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
